  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "38",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "38",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kudwala kwa Hezekiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nthawi imeneyo Mfumu Hezekiya anadwala ndipo anali pafupi kufa. Mneneri Yesaya mwana wa Amozi anapita kukamuona ndipo anati \"Yehova akuti: Konza bwino nyumba yako, pakuti ukufa; suchira.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiya anatembenuka nayangʼana kukhoma, napemphera kwa Yehova kuti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Inu Yehova, kumbukirani momwe ndayendera pamaso panu mokhulupirika ndi modzipereka ndipo ndakhala ndikuchita zabwino pamaso panu.\" Ndipo Hezekiya analira mosweka mtima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Yehova analamula Yesaya kuti:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Pita kwa Hezekiya ndipo ukamuwuze kuti, 'Yehova, Mulungu wa kholo lake Davide akuti: Ndamva pemphero lako ndipo misozi yako ndayiona; ndidzakuwonjezera zaka 15 pa moyo wako.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo ndidzakupulumutsa, iwe pamodzi ndi mzindawu mʼdzanja la mfumu ya ku Asiriya, Ine ndidzawuteteza mzindawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ichi ndi chizindikiro cha Yehova kwa iwe kutsimikiza kuti Yehova adzachita zimene walonjeza:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chithunzithunzi chimene dzuwa likuchititsa pa makwerero a Ahazi ndidzachibweza mʼmbuyo makwerero khumi.' \" Ndipo chithunzithunzi chinabwerera mʼmbuyo makwerero khumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndakatulo ya Hezekiya mfumu ya ku Yuda imene analemba atadwala ndi kuchira:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine ndinaganiza kuti",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndidzapita ku dziko la akufa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "pamene moyo ukukoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndinaganiza kuti, \"Sindidzaonanso Yehova,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "mʼdziko la anthu amoyo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "sindidzaonanso mtundu wa anthu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kapena kukhala pamodzi ndi amene amakhala pa dziko lapansi lino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyumba yanga yasasuka",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndipo yachotsedwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngati tenti ya mʼbusa mwapindapinda moyo wanga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ngati munthu wowomba nsalu;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kuyambira usana mpaka usiku mwakhala mukundisiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndinkalira kupempha chithandizo usiku wonse mpaka mmawa;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "koma Inu Yehova munaphwanya mafupa anga ngati mkango,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndipo mwakhala mukundisiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndinkalira ngati namzeze kapena chumba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndinkabuwula ngati nkhunda yodandaula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maso anga anatopa nʼkuyangʼana mlengalenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inu Ambuye, ine ndili mʼmavuto bwerani mudzandithandize!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koma ine ndinganene chiyani?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehova wayankhula nane, ndipo Iye ndiye wachita zimenezi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chifukwa cha kuwawa kwa mtima wanga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ine ndidzayenda modzichepetsa masiku amoyo wanga onse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ambuye, masiku anga ali mʼmanja mwanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mzimu wanga upeza moyo mwa Inu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Munandichiritsa ndi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kundikhalitsa ndi moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndithudi, ine ndinamva zowawa zotere",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "ISA 38:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kuti ndikhale ndi moyo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.38.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "ISA 38:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inu munandisunga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
